<title>MALTA: Yield up slightly at Malta t-bills issue.</title>
<headline>Yield up slightly at Malta t-bills issue.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Maltese Treasury on Friday will issue Lm6.7 million ($18.7 million) in 91-day Treasury bills maturing on March 7, 1997.</p>
<p>The weighted average yield rate is 5.0048 percent per annum, up from 4.9974 percent in the last 91-day issue on November 29.</p>
</text>
